     "claim": "Bollinger Bands Indicator Module - Volatility bands. This module provides the Bollinger Bands indicator developed by John Bollinger in the 1980s for measuring market volatility. Formula: midband = SimpleMovingAverage(close, period); topband = midband + devfactor * StandardDeviation(data, period); botband = midband - devfactor * StandardDeviation(data, period). 参数示例 period=20, devfactor=2.0，另提供%B线。",
     "source_type": "opensource_docs",
     "url": "https://backtrader.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/indicators/backtrader.indicators.bollinger.html",
